{"title":"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/2/0627e0c0fd7e317bb2abe11f75a2957698e4a3f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{a} + \\sin{b} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"145\" height=\"43\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a627902518405d647d6ddd79ee31022a82e7f9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos {a} + \\cos {b} = \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"154\" height=\"43\" /> Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/7/ab7ca1607fccd7225f2ea2b1b1d4a1f73a2b3149.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{(a+b)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d188dea5bab3a99600a8b388e0b73e8775bde7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }\\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\text{(B) }\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\qquad \\text{(C) }\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\qquad \\text{(D) }\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2} \\qquad \\text{(E) }1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"394\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sum to product gives us\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/3/e6398be26614a0af045fd9dd4f6a7085f288c64c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\sin(\\frac{a+b}{2})\\cos(\\frac{a-b}{2}) = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\]\" width=\"228\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e6b189eaefdbdc3e9a6af3f88c3faed5c7e73a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\cos(\\frac{a+b}{2})\\cos(\\frac{a-b}{2}) = \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}\\]\" width=\"230\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Dividing these equations tells us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324f4708fc25d0b7003f15bd21eda0eff5933cd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan(\\frac{a+b}{2}) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"138\" height=\"44\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/9/329d9e9fa5c02e43972b470813e9297ef896886e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b}{2} = \\frac{\\pi}{6} + \\pi n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"39\" /> for an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade4fd85580d738b624609f84c62e80d359a4bc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(a+b) = \\sin (\\frac{\\pi}{3} + 2\\pi n) = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"259\" height=\"43\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10d8680e45177742ecdcf12245a1a250fd1513a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"38\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~alexanderruan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P\">2002 AMC 12P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=